<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσχέρ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, opp.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχέρεια</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of things, <i>annoyance, disgust</i>
			caused by a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ φορήματος, τοῦ
				νοσήματος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				473
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				900
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				286b
			</span></i>; <i>unpleasantness</i>, of food, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				68.31
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.654b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>odium, unpopularity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				967c
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>difficulty, troublesome question</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				502d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.12
			</span></i> (pl.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.20.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς δ. ἐμπεσεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.7.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν προφοράν</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐχέρεια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				994.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in argument,
				<i>difficulties</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. λογικαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1005b22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				995a
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>harshness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				44c
			</span></i>; <i>offensiveness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>loathing, nausea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				334c
			</span></i>.</div>
